docs/WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md:112:- Use **Agents 70 Orchestrator** for readiness checks, Codex bootstrap, diagnostics, and keepalive sweeps. The **Agents 71–73 Codex Belt** now owns the queue automation loop—dispatcher selects issues, worker opens/refreshes the PR, conveyor merges after Gate, and the dispatcher is re-triggered. Historical consumer shims remain retired (see [ARCHIVE_WORKFLOWS.md](archive/ARCHIVE_WORKFLOWS.md)), and the Agent task issue template still auto-labels issues (`agents`, `agent:codex`) so the bridge can open the branch/PR before the belt takes over.
