g.md:42:- **Next validation:** Once merged, replay the PR-meta workflow on a test PR, trigger one keepalive round, and confirm that the next scheduled sweep logs `CAP: ok=false reason=run-cap-reached cap=2 active=2` until five minutes elapse.\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:1:# Keepalive Gap Assessment (2025-02)\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:8:   - The canonical marker format remains `<!-- codex-keepalive-marker --> <!-- codex-keepalive-round: N --> <!-- codex-keepalive-trace: TRACE -->`.【F:docs/keepalive/Observability_Contract.md†L43-L71】\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:9:   - `renderInstruction` now emits the canonical `codex-` prefixed `round` and `trace` markers in addition to the sentinel marker, so posted comments satisfy the documented contract.【F:.github/scripts/keepalive_contract.js†L42-L60】\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:10:   - PR-meta detection now accepts both canonical and legacy marker names during the rollout window, so historical comments still register while new instructions use the documented tags.【F:.github/scripts/agents_pr_meta_keepalive.js†L58-L92】\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:13:   - The contract defines the dispatch-edge cap as \\\"queued + in_progress orchestrator runs for this PR\\\" only.【F:docs/keepalive/Observability_Contract.md†L63-L73】\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:14:   - `countActive` and `evaluateRunCapForPr` now default to orchestrator-only accounting, keeping worker runs out of the quota unless explicitly requested by a caller.【F:.github/scripts/keepalive_gate.js†L476-L860】\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:19:  - Update `renderInstruction` to emit the `codex-keepalive-round` and `codex-keepalive-trace` markers, and adjust any regexes that parse instruction headers so the detector and orchestrator agree on the exact tags.\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:23:  - Change the run-cap evaluation calls for keepalive dispatch to set `includeWorker: false`, or flip the default so workers are ignored unless explicitly requested.\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:30:   - Affected files: `keepalive_post_work.js`, `agents-pr-meta.yml`, `agents-70-orchestrator.yml`, `agents-keepalive-dispatch-handler.yml`.\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:37:   - Applied to PR fetch calls in `keepalive_gate.js` (`evaluateRunCapForPr`, `evaluateKeepaliveGate`).\\ndocs/archive/keepalive/GapAssessment.md:52:   - **Impact:** Keepalive could not detect when acceptance criteria were satisfied, causing infinite dispatch loops.\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:128:  \\\"agents:keepalive|1d76db|Enables keepalive automation\\\"\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:149:- [ ] `agents:keepalive` label exists (blue)\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:195:| `ALLOWED_KEEPALIVE_LOGINS` | `stranske` | Users who can trigger keepalive |\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:202:- [ ] `ALLOWED_KEEPALIVE_LOGINS` variable set\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:214:| Template | Purpose | Keepalive Critical |\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:220:| `agents-keepalive-loop.yml` | Keepalive iteration | **YES** |\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:222:| `agents-pr-meta.yml` | PR metadata/keepalive detection | **YES** |\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:237:# Critical for keepalive\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:240:cp templates/consumer-repo/.github/workflows/agents-keepalive-loop.yml \\\"$DEST/\\\"\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:292:- [ ] `agents-keepalive-loop.yml` copied (uses `stranske/Workflows/.github/workflows/reusable-codex-run.yml@main`)\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:318:cp .github/scripts/keepalive_instruction_template.js \\\"$SCRIPTS_DEST/\\\"\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:336:cp .github/codex/prompts/keepalive_next_task.md \\\"$CODEX_DEST/prompts/\\\"\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:346:cp .github/templates/keepalive-instruction.md \\\"$TEMPLATES_DEST/\\\"\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN.md:354:- [ ] `.github/scripts/keepalive_instruction_template.js` present\\ndocs/TMP_TRANSITION_PLAN